    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμο-γάλακτες</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[γᾰ]</span>, οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>persons suckled
				with the same milk, foster-brothers</i> or <i>sisters :</i>
			hence, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεννῆται</span>
			, <i>clansmen, tribesmen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1252b18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philoch.
				91
			</span></i> : nom. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμογάλακτος</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Longus
				4.9
			</span></i>. (Spelt <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμογάλακες</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Philoch.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.Patm.<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> in<i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				1.152
			</span></i>, perh. rightly, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
